 a Statutes\, persons with disabilities needing a reasonable accommodation 
 to participate in this public hearing or meeting should contact the City o
 f Tampas ADA Coordinator at least 48 hours prior to the proceeding. The AD
 A Coordinator may be contacted via phone at 813-274-3964\, email at TampaA
