LOCATION:12210 USF Pine Drive Tampa \, FL 33612 United States
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a two-day celebration of all things plants! The US
 F Botanical Gardens Fall Plant Festival brings together over 50 local grow
 ers\, rare and native plants\, artisan goods\, food trucks and family-frie
 ndly activities  all in the beautiful setting of the USF Botanical Gardens
