 ogram with savings for members through October 31\, 2026. Members can rece
 ive 5 off per gallon with every qualifying fuel-up and earn Visits with qu
 alifying fuel purchases and in-store purchases. Visits can be redeemed for
  a variety of rewards\, including free food and drinks and fuel discounts 
 of up to 1 off per gallon. Inner Circle members can enjoy: - 5 off per gal
 lon on qualifying fuel-ups through October 31 - Rewards starting at 5 Visi
 ts\, including free Polar Pop and snacks - Free coffee or Monster energy d
 rinks at 10 Visits - Opportunities to earn additional Visits through perso
 nalized challenges - The ability to track Visits and redeem rewards throug
 h the Circle K app \n\nPermalink: https://www.tampa.gov/node/194771
